# KN-005: The enzyme temperature response has an activity envelope
# Candidate experiment; expected observations are not measured results.
register lv3
add v1 water 100mL @ 25C
add v1 catalase 0.000000000004mol
add v1 H2O2 0.01mol
new
add v2 water 100mL @ 35C
add v2 catalase 0.000000000004mol
add v2 H2O2 0.01mol
new
add v3 water 100mL @ 70C
add v3 catalase 0.000000000004mol
add v3 H2O2 0.01mol
wait 0.00001s
inspect
